======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 122 - The Shared Database Anti-Pattern
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   5 microservices sharing a single monolithic MySQL database schema.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Database-Per-Service: each service owns its private datastore; communication via API/events.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
